<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>I.- GEÇEN TUTANAK ÖZET&#304;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>II.- GELEN KÂ&#286;ITLAR <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>III.- OTURUM
BA&#350;KANLARININ KONU&#350;MALARI<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>1.- Oturum Ba&#351;kan&#305;
TBMM Ba&#351;kan Vekili Levent Gök’ün, 27’nci Dönem Üçüncü Yasama
Y&#305;l&#305;n&#305;n hay&#305;rl&#305; olmas&#305;n&#305; diledi&#287;ine,
emperyalizme kar&#351;&#305; verilen Kurtulu&#351; Sava&#351;&#305;’n&#305;
bugün de devam ettirecek kadrolara ve ruha sahip olundu&#287;una ili&#351;kin
konu&#351;mas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>2.- Oturum Ba&#351;kan&#305;
TBMM Ba&#351;kan Vekili Levent Gök’ün, MHP Genel Ba&#351;kan&#305; Devlet
Bahçeli’nin sa&#287;l&#305;k durumuyla ilgili olumsuz yorumun Amerikan
Büyükelçili&#287;i taraf&#305;ndan be&#287;enilmesinin Meclisimize
kar&#351;&#305; yap&#305;lm&#305;&#351; hakaret oldu&#287;una, Devlet
Bahçeli’ye geçmi&#351; olsun dileklerini iletti&#287;ine ve Millî
Saraylar&#305;n Meclise iade edilmesi gerekti&#287;ine ili&#351;kin
konu&#351;mas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>3.- Oturum Ba&#351;kan&#305;
TBMM Ba&#351;kan Vekili Levent Gök’ün, &#304;stanbul Milletvekili Hakk&#305;
Saruhan Oluç’un yerinden sarf etti&#287;i baz&#305; ifadelerine ve her siyasi
partinin belli bir konuda farkl&#305; karar alabilece&#287;ine ve buna herkesin
sayg&#305; göstermesi gerekti&#287;ine ili&#351;kin konu&#351;mas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>IV.- GÜNDEM DI&#350;I
KONU&#350;MALAR<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>A) Milletvekillerinin Gündem
D&#305;&#351;&#305; Konu&#351;malar&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>1.- Mersin Milletvekili
Hac&#305; Özkan’&#305;n, Ahilik Kültürü Haftas&#305;’na ili&#351;kin gündem d&#305;&#351;&#305;
konu&#351;mas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>2.- Diyarbak&#305;r
Milletvekili Salihe Aydeniz’in, yerel yönetimlerde ya&#351;anan sorunlara ve 19
A&#287;ustosta HDP’li belediye e&#351; ba&#351;kanlar&#305;n&#305;n görevden
al&#305;nmas&#305;n&#305;n hukuk katliam&#305; oldu&#287;una ili&#351;kin gündem
d&#305;&#351;&#305; konu&#351;mas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>3.- Antalya Milletvekili
Ayd&#305;n Özer’in, Antalya ilinde yaz serac&#305;l&#305;&#287;&#305;nda
ya&#351;anan sorunlara ili&#351;kin gündem d&#305;&#351;&#305;
konu&#351;mas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>V.- AÇIKLAMALAR<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>1.- Çanakkale Milletvekili
Bülent Turan’&#305;n, Diyarbak&#305;r Milletvekili Salihe Aydeniz’in
yapt&#305;&#287;&#305; gündem d&#305;&#351;&#305; konu&#351;mas&#305;ndaki
baz&#305; ifadelerine ili&#351;kin aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>2.- &#304;stanbul
Milletvekili Hakk&#305; Saruhan Oluç’un, Diyarbak&#305;r ili Kulp ilçesi
Belediye E&#351; Ba&#351;kanlar&#305;n&#305;n tutukland&#305;&#287;&#305;na
ili&#351;kin aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>3.- Osmaniye Milletvekili
Mücahit Durmu&#351;o&#287;lu’nun, Ahilik Kültürü Haftas&#305;’na ve &#351;ehit
edilen Yasin Börü’yü rahmetle yâd etti&#287;ine ili&#351;kin
aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>4.- Ayd&#305;n Milletvekili
Süleyman Bülbül’ün, Ayd&#305;n ilinde ölümle sonuçlanan intihar
say&#305;s&#305;ndaki art&#305;&#351;&#305;n nedenleri hakk&#305;nda
çal&#305;&#351;ma yap&#305;l&#305;p yap&#305;lmad&#305;&#287;&#305;n&#305;
ö&#287;renmek istedi&#287;ine ili&#351;kin aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>5.- K&#305;r&#305;kkale
Milletvekili Ahmet Önal’&#305;n, ya&#351;anan do&#287;al afetler sebebiyle
K&#305;r&#305;kkale ili Sulakyurt, Delice ve Keskin ilçeleri ile Çerikli
beldesi çiftçilerinin zor durumda olmas&#305; nedeniyle K&#305;r&#305;kkale
ilinin do&#287;al afet bölgesi ilan edilmesi gerekti&#287;ine ili&#351;kin
aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>6.- Mersin Milletvekili Ali
Cumhur Ta&#351;k&#305;n’&#305;n, ihracattaki yükseli&#351;in devam
etti&#287;ine ili&#351;kin aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>7.- Kocaeli Milletvekili
&#304;lyas &#350;eker’in, 26 Eylülde &#304;stanbul ilinde ya&#351;anan depremin
depreme ne kadar haz&#305;rl&#305;kl&#305; oldu&#287;umuz sorusunu
sormam&#305;z gerekti&#287;ini hat&#305;rlatt&#305;&#287;&#305;na ili&#351;kin
aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>8.- Ni&#287;de Milletvekili
Ömer Fethi Gürer’in, esnaf&#305;n, çiftçinin, i&#351;çinin, emeklinin,
engellinin, memurun, ö&#287;rencinin ve sanayicinin sorunlar&#305;na çözüm
üretilmesi gerekti&#287;ine ili&#351;kin aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>9.- U&#351;ak Milletvekili
Özkan Yal&#305;m’&#305;n, ha&#351;ha&#351; üreticilerinin ma&#287;duriyetinin
giderilmesi gerekti&#287;ine ili&#351;kin aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
