mso-no-proof:yes'>50.- Çanakkale Milletvekili Bülent Turan’&#305;n,
&#304;stanbul Milletvekili Engin Altay’&#305;n “korsan devlet” ifadesini
&#351;&#305;k bulmad&#305;&#287;&#305;na ili&#351;kin aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:2.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
