mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>ENG&#304;N
ALTAY (&#304;stanbul) – Evet, komutanlar da yalan söyler, komutanlar dokunulmaz
de&#287;ildir, söyler.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>MEL&#304;HA
AKYOL (Yalova) – Askerimiz yalan söylemez.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>BA&#350;KAN
– De&#287;erli arkada&#351;lar… Kar&#351;&#305;l&#305;kl&#305;
tart&#305;&#351;mayal&#305;m. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>Buyurun.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>ENG&#304;N
ALTAY (&#304;stanbul) – Parlamentoyu ne hâle getirdiniz.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
