mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>BA&#350;KAN
- Buyurun.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;mso-hyphenate:none;
tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;
mso-no-proof:yes'>53.- &#304;stanbul Milletvekili Engin Altay’&#305;n,
Çanakkale Milletvekili Bülent Turan’&#305;n yapt&#305;&#287;&#305;
aç&#305;klamas&#305;ndaki baz&#305; ifadelerine ili&#351;kin
aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>ENG&#304;N
ALTAY (&#304;stanbul) – Say&#305;n Ba&#351;kan, ben Bülent Turan’a, Millî
Savunma Bakanl&#305;&#287;&#305;na gidip an itibar&#305;yla Millî Savunma
Bakanl&#305;&#287;&#305;ndaki bölgenin haritas&#305;na -hani onlar böyle,
raptiye falan koyuyor ya- bakmas&#305;n&#305; tavsiye ediyorum. “D&#305;&#351;ar&#305;
gittim, tümgeneralle konu&#351;tum.”<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>BÜLENT
TURAN (Çanakkale) - Hay&#305;r hay&#305;r, orayla konu&#351;tum.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>ENG&#304;N
ALTAY (&#304;stanbul) – O tümgeneraline söyle beni de aras&#305;n o zaman. (CHP
s&#305;ralar&#305;ndan alk&#305;&#351;lar)<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>BÜLENT
TURAN (Çanakkale) - Niye ba&#287;&#305;r&#305;yorsun, sakin ol.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>ENG&#304;N
ALTAY (&#304;stanbul) – Beni de aras&#305;n. Benim bir endi&#351;em var.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>BÜLENT
TURAN (Çanakkale) - Say&#305;n Ba&#351;kan, olur mu öyle &#351;ey? “Beni
aras&#305;n.” ne demek? <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>ENG&#304;N
ALTAY (&#304;stanbul) – Bir dakika, ben ayaktay&#305;m daha. Tümgeneral senin
tümgeneralin mi? Beni arayacak o tümgeneral. Sesleniyorum o tümgenerale, beni
aras&#305;n!<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>BA&#350;KAN
– Say&#305;n Turan, siz oturun. Varsa ben söz veririm. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:2.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:40.55pt;
mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.6pt'>ENG&#304;N
ALTAY (&#304;stanbul) – 9 numaral&#305; gözlem noktas&#305;na Rusya’n&#305;n
oluru olmadan TSK’nin -haberle&#351;me ayr&#305; bir &#351;ey,
telefonla&#351;ma ayr&#305; bir &#351;ey- lojistik destek yapma &#351;ans&#305;
yoktur. Bunu bütün dünya biliyor. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:2.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
42.55pt;mso-pagination:none;mso-hyphenate:none;tab-stops:92.8pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:1.6pt'>&#304;SMET YILMAZ (Sivas) – Gözlem noktalar&#305;n&#305;
Rusya’yla beraber ç&#305;kartt&#305; yani insaf! Burada Rusya’n&#305;n da var,
&#304;ran’&#305;n da var, bizim de var. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

